su name audio equilibrium from filename input to filename output be ceremony def
  ob name run root to name text workspace root be text do
  su name equilibrium input path stage ob filename of from of this to name text equilibrium input path be text do
  su name equilibrium output path stage ob filename of to of this to name text equilibrium output path be text do

  ob text "node \"" to name text equilibrium command be text do
  ob name text workspace root to name equilibrium command be plus do
  ob text "/command/audio_equilibrium.mjs\" \"" to name equilibrium command be plus do
  ob name text equilibrium input path to name equilibrium command be plus do
  ob text "\" \"" to name equilibrium command be plus do
  ob name text equilibrium output path to name equilibrium command be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name equilibrium command be plus do
  su name equilibrium stage ob name text equilibrium command be command do

  su name result ob filename of to of this be filename ya
  su name result ret
prah

exists su name audio equilibrium be export ya
